cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software or its results in your work, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "Adaptive Physical Communication System (APCS)"
abstract: >-
  A Flutter app for Android, iOS and the web that sends text, links, photos
  and short videos from one phone to another using only light (animated
  fountain-coded QR codes), sound (16-ary multi-tone FSK with Reed-Solomon
  error correction and LT fountain coding, including a near-ultrasonic
  18-20 kHz band) or vibration, with no radio of any kind in the data path.
authors:
  - family-names: "S"
    given-names: "Harsharaj"
repository-code: "https://github.com/harsharaj-s/adaptive_physical_communication_system"
license: MIT
version: "1.0.0"
keywords:
  - screen-camera communication
  - acoustic modem
  - fountain code
  - LT code
  - Reed-Solomon
  - FSK
  - QR code
  - near-ultrasonic
  - Flutter
